+/** HST Office: the Start Center, the window shown when no document is open. It is drawn by one
+    canvas in the HST look (sfx2/source/startcenter/hststartcentercanvas.hxx), alike on every
+    platform: at the left the HST Office logo, the menu (Home, New document, Open file, Unsaved
+    documents, Recent, Pinned, Update HST Office) and the HASON TECH banner and solutions; in the
+    centre the welcome, a search over the recent documents, three tiles that create a text document,
+    a spreadsheet or a presentation, and the table of recent documents; at the right the pinned
+    files. Only the search entry and the banner are toolkit widgets, placed into the canvas's slots.
+    The recent documents and their pinning are the profile's history. */
